      "writtenOn": "2023-11-30T03:04:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, are you worrying about pvmfw itself could be untrustable so that it can cause a problem when there\u0027s an update except pvmfw?\n\nI think it\u0027s a good catch.. I haven\u0027t thought about updatability of pvmfw, but I agree w/ you it may cause a security problem. I\u0027ll keep this change as `CR-1` until finding a way to solve this.\nCould you briefly explain about the updatability of pvmfw? Is the update cycle binded to virt APEX?",
