      "side": 1,
      "message": "Cool, would you mind clearing this up in the TODO?\n\n\u003e BTW, this patch is needed for enabling vendor partition verification of non-protected VM as well.\n\nDo you mean `--protected-vm-with-firmware`?\n\nBecause AFAIK, pvmfw doesn\u0027t run for non-protected VMs.",
